            <div xml:id="d1137">

                <pb facs="0941" n="825" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg825"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/4643.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Consul at Ciudad
                            Juárez to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.—Paraphrases.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Ciudad Juárez</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-08-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 16, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Last remnant of Orozco’s army evacuated Juárez this morning. Federal forces
                    expected within two days, with restoration of normal conditions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Edwards.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
